## Tooling

Error analysis was performed using a custom script (`tools/error_analyzer.py`) that:
- Runs inference on the test set
- Matches predictions to ground truth boxes via IoU (threshold 0.5)
- Classifies each result as True Positive, False Positive, or False Negative
- Saves annotated images (green = correct, red = false positive, orange = missed defect) for every image containing at least one error

This complements the aggregate metrics in `05_evaluation.md` by making individual failure cases directly inspectable rather than summarized only as a single score.